cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this audit or its ledger, cite it as below."
title: "895 public freqtrade strategies, measured out of sample"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Apex-prim"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Apex-prim/strategy-audit"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-08-20"
version: "2026.09"
abstract: >-
  Every public freqtrade strategy that could be found and loaded — 895 unique
  classes from 53 repositories — run by freqtrade itself in the author's window
  and out of sample. Every number is regenerated from LEDGER.csv and a CI gate
  fails if the README disagrees. A second, static auditor is calibrated against
  the dynamic one on the same ledger: precision 100 %, sensitivity 45 %. A
  content-hash lineage of 2173 distinct public strategies shows 56 % of the
  corpus to be copies, 89 of them carrying a lookahead defect their original
  owner had labelled.
keywords:
  - freqtrade
  - backtesting
  - lookahead-bias
  - out-of-sample
  - trading-strategies
